{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/13/4374000/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14th 新制服だよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり制服が写ってないんだけども"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/13/4374000/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色はグレーとネイビーの2色"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人がグレーで\n子供がネイビー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも通り\n選抜の平均、アンダーの平均\nで制服をわけてるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は大人のグレーです～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜だと94年組は子供になるやつね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんどん目にする機会が増えてきますが\nよろしくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/13/4374000/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いては\nROZILLAの『奏』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小山シェフのお店ですね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/13/4374000/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/02/13/4374000/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パッケージしか写メを撮ってなくて\n申し訳ない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見た目はだいぶシックになるけど\n美味しいからプレゼントしたくなる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blo